// trex_arena — the Tyrant King's arena (`docs/planning/game/bosses.md`, "The
// Tyrant King"). Reached from the Hall of Bosses gallery.
//
// Behaviour + encounter are data-authored:
//   assets/data/boss_profiles.ron           (the pattern: which move, when)
//   assets/data/boss_encounters/trex_boss.ron (HP/phases/music)
// and his conductor (`ambition_content_modules::trex`) walks him and performs
// the moves.
//
// A wide hall, because the fight's long punish window is his charge: he runs
// the floor and cannot stop, and hits the wall. Two refuges from it, one by
// each wall: a LEDGE above the reach of his lowered head (floor - 208; the ram
// tops out at floor - 144), reached from a STEP (floor - 112), which the ram
// does reach — a path, not a place to stand. A ledge is no refuge from HIM: he
// snaps up at it.
//
//   |▓ceiling▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓|
//   |                                                            |
//   |░ledge░░░                                         ░░░ledge░|
//   |          ░step░                          ░step░            |
//   |[door] @                          T-REX                     |
//   |▓floor▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓|
